findings.body:
**`docs/PROCESS.md` now contradicts the merge gate.**

AGENTS.md says merging follows `docs/PROCESS.md`. Lines 65-67 there still say PR Auto-Merge waits until "Copilot has reviewed its latest commit" and stops waiting "after three Copilot review rounds".

After this PR:
- a marked Claude review also satisfies the gate;
- Claude rounds count toward the cap;
- Claude threads are bypassed at the cap;
- Claude findings outside the diff hold the merge.

None of `review:claude`, what it does, or how to clear the off-diff hold is documented for contributors.

Fix: update the "Checks, review and merging" section of `docs/PROCESS.md` along with this workflow.
